// THE THREE TZHAAR TRADERS, and the reason they are new npcs rather than three of the existing ones.
//
// 377 has 26 TzHaar in the city - tzhaar_hur1-6, tzhaar_mej1-7, tzhaar_xil1-6, tzhaar_ket1-7 - and
// every one of them is a nameless attackable monster with op2=Attack and nothing else. There was no
// shopkeeper to give a shop to. Meanwhile scripts/_unpack/727/all.inv has carried
// tzhaar_shop_equipment, tzhaar_shop_oreandgem and tzhaar_shop_rune all along, stocked, with a note
// pointing at the wiki's "Unused shops" page - three shops and nobody to open them.
//
// So these three are the shopkeepers OSRS has, built out of the models and recolours the city's own
// TzHaar already use: the two Hur wear the craftsman's colours, the Mej the mystic's. They do not
// fight - vislevel=hide, no op2 - which is what makes them safe to stand beside while buying.
//
// WHERE THEY STAND (fixed 2026-09-21). They were first spawned round TzHaar-Mej-Jal at the Fight Cave
// entrance, on the belief above that the city had no shopkeepers - but the 2004 map DOES spawn three,
// tzhaar_merchant_* in _unpack/377/all.npc, at the stalls: Hur-Tel by the weapon shop (46,26 of
// m38_80), Hur-Lek by the gem shop (32,29), Mej-Roh by the magic shop (30,5). Those merchants trade
// in coins. These three now stand on those tiles instead, and the merchants' spawns are gone, so
// there is one of each, at its stall, taking Tokkul. wanderrange=1 keeps them at the counter.
//
// THEY TRADE IN TOKKUL, which is what this round was for. param=shop_currency is new (see
// shop/configs/shopkeeper.param): the shop system said "coins" in six places and now reads the
// param, so the 29 shopkeepers that had no idea this existed keep working untouched.

[tzhaar_shopkeeper_equipment]
wanderrange=1
name=TzHaar-Hur-Tel
desc=He looks like he deals in weapons.
model1=npc_2591
model2=npc_2591i2
model3=npc_2591i3
model4=npc_2591i4
recol1s=29921
recol1d=15424
recol2s=8291
recol2d=13708
walkanim=thzaar_walk
readyanim=thzaar_ready
head1=npc_2591_head
contrast=0
ambient=10
resizeh=120
resizev=120
vislevel=hide
op1=Talk-to
op3=Trade
category=shop_keeper
param=owned_shop,tzhaar_shop_equipment
param=shop_currency,tzhaar_token
param=shop_sell_multiplier,1000
param=shop_buy_multiplier,600
param=shop_delta,10
param=shop_title,TzHaar-Hur-Tel's Equipment Store

